<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY PRIME MINISTER ON TWO-DAY VISIT TO NORWAY.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY PRIME MINISTER ON TWO-DAY VISIT TO NORWAY.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian Prime Minister Gyula Horn will visit Norway on Tuesday and Wednesday to participate in an investment lecture and meet Norwegian politicians, the official MTI news agency said on Monday.</p>
<p>Horn is expected to meet with Norwegian Prime Minister Thorbjorn Jagland and with King Harald V, as well as other politicians and businessman, MTI added.</p>
</text>
